            <ArticleTitle>Open reduction and 3-dimensional ulnar osteotomy for chronic radial head dislocation using a computer-generated template: case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>517-22</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jhsa.2011.10.047</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of a radial head dislocation that was successfully treated 8 years after the initial injury, by open reduction of the radial head and 3-dimensional ulnar osteotomy, using a computer-generated template based on preoperative 3-dimensional computer simulation.</AbstractText>
